wine-sg (10.0-540) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 6510 windows.media.speech: the WinRT synthesizer speaks. AllVoices and
    DefaultVoice are SAPI's voices; SynthesizeTextToStreamAsync and
    SynthesizeSsmlToStreamAsync speak through the voice's engine (eSpeak
    NG, 6508) into an audio/wav stream with word and sentence markers,
    rate, volume and pitch; SSML breaks are pauses. Gate test-wmsynth.

