wine-sg (10.0-539) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 6070 dnsapi: DNS dynamic update (RFC 2136): DnsModifyRecordsInSet and
    DnsReplaceRecordSet send an unsigned update to the zone's primary server
    and return its answer instead of claiming success; a secure-only update
    fails with ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED. Gate test/dnsupdate-gate.sh (its own
    network namespace and name server), mutant SG_MUTANT_UPDATE_NO_DELETE.

